          "text": "Can count it? → MANY",
          "voice_line": "If you <emphasis level=\"strong\">CAN</emphasis> count it — use <emphasis level=\"strong\">MANY</emphasis>. Many books. You can count books: one, two, three. Many people. Many days. Many mistakes. Count it — <emphasis level=\"strong\">MANY</emphasis>.",
